# What this site reads from the OS repo (arclight-digital/pulsar), one path
# per line, relative to that repo's root. The OS repo's scripts/publish.sh
# copies each into upstream/ in the same commit as each published nightly's
# changelog and manifest -- so the page's marks, fonts, shader and docs are
# always the ones the shipped image was built from, and never a night early.
# Edit this list here; never edit upstream/ by hand (the next nightly
# replaces it).
assets/brand/svg/pulsar-animated.svg
assets/brand/svg/pulsar-animated-large.svg
assets/brand/svg/pulsar-mark-small.svg
assets/brand/svg/pulsar-mark-small-light.svg
assets/brand/svg/pulsar-mark-light.svg
assets/brand/svg/favicon.svg
assets/brand/png/favicon-16.png
assets/brand/png/favicon-32.png
assets/brand/png/favicon-48.png
# the share cards (src/og/render.ts)
assets/brand/png/pulsar-lockup-horizontal.png
assets/brand/png/pulsar-mark-1024.png
assets/fonts/JetBrains_Mono/static/JetBrainsMono-Bold.ttf
assets/fonts/Host_Grotesk/static/HostGrotesk-Regular.ttf
assets/fonts/Host_Grotesk/static/HostGrotesk-Bold.ttf
assets/fonts/Host_Grotesk/OFL.txt
assets/fonts/JetBrains_Mono/static/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf
assets/fonts/JetBrains_Mono/OFL.txt
assets/shaders/pulsar.frag
# the live sky recolors this per theme, with the uniforms publish.sh writes
# to upstream/theme-uniforms.json (scripts/render-theme-wallpapers.py --uniforms)
assets/shaders/theme.frag
# the looks both shaders are assembled from, one file each, in looks.json's order
assets/shaders/looks/*.glsl
assets/shaders/looks/looks.json
docs/*.md
